	"notice": "Select the appropriate MIDI input/output route and matching transmit/receive channels. Performance Part assignments and MIDI I/O mode affect channel behavior; prevent duplicate notes by setting Local Control appropriately for DAW routing. USB TO HOST is the computer connection. This is MODX+, not the original MODX or MODX M. Four physical control sliders switch between Part banks; their assignments are not fixed CC mappings. Exact browser MIDI port names are not verified; select this profile manually. The selected-control schematics are illustrative. Keys and panel controls remain unbound because channel, octave, mode and assignable functions must be checked against the instrument setup. This is a partial hardware and setup profile, not a complete MIDI implementation.",
